      "id": "document:docs/agent_profiles/_template.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "_template.md",
      "filePath": "docs/agent_profiles/_template.md",
      "summary": "统一 Agent profile 模板，定义所有 profile 必须包含的 12 个字段：定位、适用/不适用场景、输入输出、必须做到、禁止事项、验收问题、退化信号、Loop交接、Token策略、Side-effect Gate。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-profile",
        "template"
      ],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "language": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/agent_profiles/architect.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "architect.md",
      "filePath": "docs/agent_profiles/architect.md",
      "summary": "观澜·架构眼 profile：系统级架构决策判断者，回答'这条路走不走得通'。定义约束分析、方案取舍、边界画定等职责，含知识图谱 CR 实战经验沉淀。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-profile",
        "architect",
        "观澜"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "language": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/agent_profiles/coordinator.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "coordinator.md",
      "filePath": "docs/agent_profiles/coordinator.md",
      "summary": "Coordinator profile：控制 Loop 节奏、上下文压缩、证据收集、side-effect gate 和交接，把多 Agent 输出收束为可执行的下一步决策。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-profile",
        "coordinator"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "language": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/agent_profiles/coordinator_persona.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "coordinator_persona.md",
      "filePath": "docs/agent_profiles/coordinator_persona.md",
      "summary": "临渊·协调者人格层：叠加在 Coordinator profile 上的人格表达层，职责不变但增加裁决式表达、矛盾分析、操控化退化信号检测等人格行为模式。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-profile",
        "coordinator",
        "临渊",
        "persona-layer"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "language": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:docs/agent_profiles/greykey.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "greykey.md",
      "filePath": "docs/agent_profiles/greykey.md",
      "summary": "灰钥·Greykey profile：编码现场守门人格，负责砍需求、查复用、删复杂度、守安全底线、写最小代码。含 Loop 交接、Ponytail-CN handoff、退化信号（喷子化等6类）定义。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-profile",
        "greykey",
        "灰钥",
        "coding"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "language": "markdown"
    },
