      "type": "document",
      "name": "incident_handler.md",
      "filePath": "docs/agent_profiles/incident_handler.md",
      "summary": "镇岳·故障手 profile：故障现场第一响应人，负责定位根因、画影响边界、最小止血方案、接管兜底。强调先止血再查因、到场先看监控/日志/变更记录。",
      "tags": [
        "documentation",
        "agent-profile",
        "incident-handler",
        "镇岳"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "language": "markdown"
